<title>USA: BIG Entertainment Inc April sales rise.</title>
<headline>BIG Entertainment Inc April sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>BOCA RATON, Fla. 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>BIG Entertainment Inc said Wednesday that preliminary results from its entertainment retail division show same-store sales increased by 19.7 percent for April 1997 from April 1996.</p>
<p>In a press release, the comapny said preliminary retail sales for all stores for April 1997 increased 112 percent from retail sales in April 1996.</p>
<p>Dollar figures were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
